      "updated_at": "2026-07-01T09:40:50Z",
      "body": "We call this behavior out in our [docs (multithreading box)](https://ref.rerun.io/docs/python/0.33.1/rerun/#rerun.RecordingStream). But I can see how this is unintuitive in this case.\n\nThe above might make sense in a streaming case but probably not for file sinks.\n\nWe probably want to treat these two cases differently:\n\n```python\nstream.save(path)\nwith stream:\n   ...\n ```\n\nand\n\n```python\nwith stream:\n   stream.save(path)\n   ...\n```",
